  │h / ←       Collapse / deselect       { / }       Output top / bottom     │
  │l / →       Expand / select           Shift+Home  Output top              │
  │Space       Toggle selection          Shift+End   Output bottom           │
  │E           Expand all groups         Tab         Type into the command   │
  │W           Collapse all groups       Ctrl+R      Toggle fullscreen       │
  │/           Search and filter         L           Toggle log panel        │
  │Run                                   Other                               │
  │Enter       Run selected commands     ?           Toggle this help        │
  │r           Run command or group      q / Ctrl+C  Quit                    │
  │s           Stop command              Searching                           │
  │x           Clear command             Enter       Keep the filter         │
  │g           Select by git changes     Esc         Clear the search        │
  │F5          Reload the config         Typing into a command               │
  │w           Toggle auto-run           Ctrl+]      Back to the tree        │
